/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store

# Generated media, traces and local diagnostics. `AGENTS.md` forbids committing
# these; the re-base branch had 42 of them tracked, including a latency log that
# contained a live Chutes API key.
/output

# Stray `env` dumps from the notification-hook tests. The tests interpolated an
# unquoted Windows path into `sh -c`, so the redirect landed in the crate root
# under a mangled name — and `env` prints the whole environment, API key
# included. The tests are fixed; this is the second line of defence, because a
# `git add -A` should never be able to sweep up a credential.
CUsers*env.txt
*AppDataLocalTemp*

# Python bytecode from the rebrand/sweep scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
